te to create interactive maps with dynamic styling based on user interactions."}],"kind":"article","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/featurestateexample","type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNPolyline":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnpolyline","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolyline","isActive":true},{"text":" object represents a shape consisting of two or more vertices,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"specified as ","type":"text"},{"code":"CLLocationCoordinate2D","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" instances, and the line segments that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"connect them. For example, you could use an polyline to represent a road or the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"path along which something moves.","type":"text"}],"title":"MLNPolyline","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolyline","fragments":[{"text":"MLNPolyline","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/AnimatedLineExample":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/AnimatedLineExample","title":"Animated Line","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add an animated line to a map"}],"kind":"article","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/animatedlineexample","type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource/initWithIdentifier:URL:options:":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource\/initwithidentifier:url:options:","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:URL:options:","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a shape source with an identifier, URL, and dictionary of options for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the source."}],"title":"initWithIdentifier:URL:options:","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithIdentifier:URL:options:","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNVectorTileSource":{"title":"MLNVectorTileSource","abstract":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" is a map content source that supplies tiled vector data","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in ","type":"text"},{"text":"Mapbox Vector Tile","type":"text"},{"text":" format","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to be shown on the map. The location of and metadata about the tiles are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"defined either by an option dictionary or by an external file that conforms to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"TileJSON specification","type":"text"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A vector tile source is added to an ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle"},{"text":" object along with one or more","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer"},{"text":" objects. A vector style layer defines the appearance of","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"any content supplied by the vector tile source."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnvectortilesource","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNVectorTileSource"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/FeatureStateVectorExample":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This example demonstrates feature state on a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", toggling the appearance of countries in a vector tileset as they are tapped."}],"title":"Set Feature State (Vector Source)","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/featurestatevectorexample","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/FeatureStateVectorExample","role":"article"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNPointCollection":{"fragments":[{"text":"MLNPointCollection","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPointCollection","title":"MLNPointCollection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPointCollection","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object represents a shape consisting of one or more"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"disconnected vertices, specified as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CLLocationCoordinate2D"},{"text":" instances. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"points in the collection may be related but are not connected spatially. For"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"example, you could use a point collection to represent all the trees in an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"orchard.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnpointcollection","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShape":{"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNShape"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","title":"MLNShape","abstract":[{"isActive":true,"typ